#: ../../entities/wuning.rst:1
msgid "Wuning Science Park"
msgstr "上海武宁科技园"

#: ../../entities/wuning.rst:4
msgid "上海武宁科技园"
msgstr "上海武宁科技园"

#: ../../entities/wuning.rst:6
msgid "Technology park | Putuo | Research checked 2026-11-04"
msgstr "科技园区｜普陀区｜资料核查日期 2026-11-04"

#: ../../entities/wuning.rst:8
msgid "AI and industry focus: Hardware AI, Industry."
msgstr "AI及产业方向：AI硬件、产业。"

#: ../../entities/wuning.rst:10
msgid ""
"An industrial research and testing environment operated by the Shanghai "
"Electrical Apparatus Research Institute group. Robot and "
"industrial-internet testing are useful entry points for hardware "
"validation."
msgstr "由上海电器科学研究所集团运营，提供工业研发及检测服务。机器人和工业互联网团队可关注相关检测及硬件验证资源。"

#: ../../entities/wuning.rst:12
msgid ""
"`Evidence S013 <https://www.shpt.gov.cn/ys-cyyq/20260430/969703.html>`_. "
"上海武宁科技园_创业园区_上海市普陀区人民政府."
msgstr "`资料来源 S013 <https://www.shpt.gov.cn/ys-cyyq/20260430/969703.html>`_. 上海武宁科技园_创业园区_上海市普陀区人民政府."

#: ../../entities/wuning.rst:14
msgid "Status and support"
msgstr "项目状态与支持内容"

#: ../../entities/wuning.rst:17
msgid "Published entity; intake to confirm"
msgstr "机构信息已核实，当前是否接受申请需确认"

#: ../../entities/wuning.rst:19
msgid ""
"No standard cash award, fee waiver or equity percentage is verified for "
"this entry. Request the current written offer."
msgstr "尚未确认统一的现金资助额度、费用减免或股权比例，请向运营机构索取最新书面方案。"

#: ../../entities/wuning.rst:21
msgid "Contact and location"
msgstr "联系方式与地址"

#: ../../entities/wuning.rst:24
msgid ""
"`Official evidence and authority route "
"<https://www.shpt.gov.cn/ys-cyyq/20260430/969703.html>`_"
msgstr "`官方资料及主管部门 <https://www.shpt.gov.cn/ys-cyyq/20260430/969703.html>`_"

#: ../../entities/wuning.rst:26
msgid ""
"Published address: Wuning Road area, Putuo; confirm the service building."
msgstr "公开地址：普陀区武宁路片区，服务楼宇需确认。"

#: ../../entities/wuning.rst:28
msgid ""
"Use the official website to request the responsible team and current "
"application route. Email addresses are not reproduced in this publication."
msgstr "请通过官网咨询具体负责部门及最新申请方式。本图谱不公开电子邮箱地址。"

#: ../../entities/wuning.rst:30
msgid ""
"Map position uses a district or campus anchor; it is not a verified "
"office location."
msgstr "地图采用行政区或校区参考点，不代表已核实的办公地址。"

#: ../../entities/wuning.rst:32
msgid "Application workflow"
msgstr "申请流程"

#: ../../entities/wuning.rst:35
msgid ""
"Editorial application checklist. The current official notice or agreement "
"controls the actual procedure."
msgstr "以下步骤为本书整理的申请参考，实际办理流程以最新官方通知或协议为准。"

#: ../../entities/wuning.rst:37
msgid ""
"Describe the prototype, required equipment, process and testing needs."
msgstr "介绍样机，列明设备、工艺及测试需求。"

#: ../../entities/wuning.rst:39
msgid "Ask for a technical review, facility visit and itemized quotation."
msgstr "申请技术评估和设施参观，并索取分项报价。"

#: ../../entities/wuning.rst:41
msgid ""
"Agree access, safety, sample and IP ownership, test scope and acceptance."
msgstr "约定使用权限、安全责任、样品及知识产权归属、测试范围和验收标准。"

#: ../../entities/wuning.rst:43
msgid ""
"Separate the facility contract from investment or public-funding "
"applications."
msgstr "设施服务合同与投资、财政资助分别办理。"

#: ../../entities/wuning.rst:45
msgid ":doc:`Putuo district route </districts/putuo>`"
msgstr ":doc:`普陀区合作指南 </districts/putuo>`"

